Subject: [PATCH 9/9] geph5-app: follow pac_addr() in manager.rs

One-line follower: apply_proxy() formats the PAC URL handed to
set_system_proxy from supervisor::PAC_ADDR, which became a function in
patch 0008. Exists as its own patch because the series is strictly one file
per patch.

Trivially mergeable; if this ever rejects, upstream moved the URL
construction and patch 0008 will need re-deriving anyway.
